{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-136618",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14255188/assets/08d442eff9febe44bd39e6c15c998d76d56d17bbb7a676d2d511771479bb2f29.png)\n\nFrom the graph, we note the following:\n\n- The period of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ is $2\\pi .$\n\n- Our graph has rotational symmetry of order $2$ about the origin. This means that $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ is an *odd* function, and we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x)=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\n$$\n\nLet's now evaluate our expression:\n\n- Firstly, using the periodicity of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x-4\\pi ) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x-2\\pi \\cdot 2) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Secondly, using the oddness of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x) & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =-0.44.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x-4\\pi )=-0.44.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-136618\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>First, let's recall the graph of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"52\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-136618-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-136618-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>From the graph, we note the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The period of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"53\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Our graph has rotational symmetry of order <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> about the origin. This means that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"56\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is an <em>odd</em> function, and we have\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"57\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let's now evaluate our expression:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Firstly, using the periodicity of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"58\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> we have\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"59\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 13.853em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mj